The SYSGEN parameter RJOBLIM controls the number of remote logins allowed on
your system.  The default value is 16.

Add the desired value of RJOBLIM into your SYS$SYSTEM:MODPARAMS.DAT and
AUTOGEN.  This takes care of subsequent boots.  Since this is a dymanic
parameter so you can change it for the current boot as follows:

	$ RUN SYS$SYSTEM:SYSGEN
	SYSGEN> SET RJOBLIM 32			! pick a number...
	SYSGEN> WRITE ACTIVE
	SYSGEN> EXIT
	$

