  You need to include the /transport qualifier to the set display
  command for any transport that is not DECNET.  The command to use
  is:

  set display /create /transport=tcpip /node=sorcerer.msfc.nasa.gov

  the tcpip transport is valid for UCX and Multinet.  I believe it's
  something else for WINTCP and CMU-TEK (other TCP/IP vender software).

