turned off for good reason, but rather the debug feature which allows you
to, among other things, run the queue in debug mode and watch the rules in
each ruleset be processed in order:

  sendmail -q -d21.12

The Latter feature is turned off on ULTRIX's sendmail, and that makes ULTRIX
sendmail worse than useless as far as I am concerned. I have learned that
