understand OSF/1 correctly (fat chance :-), all things from all vendors 
called OSF/1 are compiled up from the same source pools, implying that all 
OSF/1 sendmails should act alike. True?

Now for another related question :-)

Will there be a mail11 channel available to DEC-OSF/1? The fact that ULTRIX
sendmail requires an ``enhanced'' SMTP like protocol to converse with 
the ULTRIX mail11 channel program forces people that want to use the
generic ULTRIX mail11 channel program to use the sendmail executable 
supplied with ULTRIX - which in my opinion, as stated above, is 
worse than worthless. Hence my curiosity about if and how mail11 will
be available to DEC-OSF/1.

