average), or the average rotational latency?  I suspect head positioning
(and probably average rather than single-track or maximum), partly since
a 10.5ms average latency would imply a rotational speed less than 3600rpm.

If my guess is correct, what about the other important figure:  How fast do
these thing spin?  (The Fuji M2694S is 5400rpm, the fastest I've seen in a
