In addition to recompiling the kernel, the /dev devices are also
different between the 5000s and the 3100s.  The wrong major number on
/dev/mouse is probably causing the panics.  You should also change the
serial port major numbers it won't panic when you access those.

You'll need to change the following devices to:
	/dev/mouse		45	1
	/dev/tty00		45	2
	/dev/tty01		45	3

