Jeff,
 
It is always difficult to make diagnoses without complete data, 
but the problem that you are describing sounds like a clock 
problem. The startup process relies upon the system clock 
running. If you disable the clock (or misconfigure the clock 
interrupt), then the startup process will hang.
 
