>We have a DEC 3000 model 500 on order. I have just discovered a need to
>put the system unit and the monitor/keyboard/mouse in different rooms.
>The rooms are adjacent, but the distance between the system unit and the
>monitor may be as much as 40 to 50 feet. DEC doesn't make a cable long
