> Or to summarize, if DEC want to sell VMS they should sell it on other platforms.
> It must have been ported to MIPS 4000 at some time during the port to Alpha.
> Given that it would be competing with W/NT it would not need to be particularly
> fast on non DEC machines - just offer the ease of system maintenance and
> robustness. W/NT is going to be incomplete for quite a while yet.
