Clarification of postings about OS on Alpha PC:

DEC will release Alpha PC running Microsoft's Windows NT
when NT ships to customers, projected at end of May,
Comdex/Windows World.

DEC will release OpenVMS AXP 1.0 for Alpha AXP PCs around
the same time.

DEC is still considering porting OSF/1 to the Alpha AXP PC.
DEC has already ported OSF/1 to higher-end Alphas and
has announced plans for a low-cost workstation (not the
Alpha AXP PC) running either OpenVMS AXP or OSF/1.
DEC is also considering porting Windows NT to workstations
and servers bigger than the Alpha AXP PC, but is not
prepared to say anything about that right now.

So, if you need or want OSF/1 on the Alpha AXP PC, now is
the time to speak up.  If you need or want Windows NT on
anything other than the Alpha PC in DEC's line, now is the
time to speak up.  DEC is listening to its customers.

